WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.150
Episode 13

01:53.050 --> 01:55.770
Fan Xian should be here soon.

01:56.010 --> 01:59.090
Take it easy. I'm early.

02:14.650 --> 02:16.640
I'll get another cup for you.

02:23.420 --> 02:25.090
The cup cracked for no reason.

02:26.570 --> 02:28.200
It's a bad omen.

02:30.490 --> 02:32.480
This place looks familiar.

02:33.010 --> 02:34.840
It's where you hit Guo Baokun.

02:35.140 --> 02:37.810
Then it's a memorable place.

02:38.900 --> 02:40.040
Niulan Street.

02:40.370 --> 02:40.980
Speaking of this,

02:40.980 --> 02:42.270
you still owe me an ox.

02:42.290 --> 02:44.330
I'll get you one when we go back to Danzhou.

02:44.420 --> 02:45.450
Luckily, I went to Danzhou.

02:45.450 --> 02:46.470
Luckily, I met you.

02:46.490 --> 02:47.210
Or I don't know

02:47.210 --> 02:47.900
when I could

02:47.900 --> 02:49.270
see my wife and son,

02:49.290 --> 02:50.090
let alone

02:50.090 --> 02:52.400
getting rid of hatred.

02:52.820 --> 02:54.090
Fan Xian.

02:55.010 --> 02:56.350
Thank you.

02:56.370 --> 02:58.480
I'll throw up if you say the phrase again.

04:19.650 --> 04:21.040
Cheng Jushu!

04:40.680 --> 04:42.270
=Cheng Jushu, Eighth Dan Martial Arts Master of Beiqi=

04:55.650 --> 04:57.350
Why are you in such a hurry?

04:57.370 --> 04:58.860
Cheng Jushu showed up on Niulan Street.

04:58.860 --> 05:00.190
He's fighting someone.

05:00.210 --> 05:01.880
Cheng Jushu from Beiqi?

05:02.260 --> 05:04.440
He's an Eighth Dan Martial Arts Master.

05:05.490 --> 05:07.320
Who can be a match for him?

06:17.650 --> 06:19.250
Are you alive?

06:22.460 --> 06:24.010
You still owe me

06:24.170 --> 06:26.160
a piece of land and an ox.

06:26.370 --> 06:27.970
I won't die before you give them to me.

06:36.370 --> 06:38.090
Did you use poisoned daggers?

06:39.370 --> 06:40.690
Yeah.

06:40.770 --> 06:42.090
That would be great.

06:44.300 --> 06:45.570
You leave now.

06:46.980 --> 06:48.480
Didn't you use poisoned daggers?

06:49.170 --> 06:50.870
He's nobody but Cheng Jushu.

06:50.890 --> 06:53.290
An Eighth Dan Martial Arts Master. He's invincible.

06:53.460 --> 06:55.010
I'm afraid he won't be hurt.

06:56.740 --> 06:58.090
Let's go together.

07:27.370 --> 07:28.640
Go!

07:30.090 --> 07:31.480
How?

07:36.610 --> 07:38.290
He's still alive.

07:38.700 --> 07:40.350
He's lucky.

07:40.370 --> 07:41.630
If my vitality Qi bursts,

07:41.650 --> 07:43.160
he'll definitely die.

07:52.170 --> 07:53.520
If I die,

07:53.540 --> 07:55.480
take good care of Ruoruo.

07:55.540 --> 07:56.750
Tell Wan'er

07:56.770 --> 07:58.480
phthisis is curable

07:58.820 --> 08:00.690
and she can find someone better than me.

08:04.890 --> 08:06.290
Go to

08:06.420 --> 08:08.320
tell her the crap yourself.

08:51.780 --> 08:53.450
Teng Zijing!

08:54.900 --> 08:56.770
Teng Zijing!

10:56.290 --> 10:57.600
Your Excellency.

10:58.780 --> 11:00.160
Your Excellency, wake up.

11:05.490 --> 11:06.720
Your Excellency.

11:08.020 --> 11:09.520
Your Excellency. Don't move.

11:09.820 --> 11:11.650
Don't move until your wounds are inspected.

11:12.460 --> 11:13.800
Our colleagues

11:13.820 --> 11:15.650
will be here soon.

11:22.730 --> 11:24.160
Wake him up.

11:25.780 --> 11:27.370
He'll never wake up.

11:29.730 --> 11:30.960
Your Excellency.

11:32.610 --> 11:33.840
Your Excellency.

11:54.050 --> 11:55.840
What did he say to you?

11:56.730 --> 11:58.040
He's already dead

11:58.660 --> 12:00.400
when I'm here.

12:08.610 --> 12:10.440
You said

12:10.460 --> 12:13.210
you'd only die for your family.

12:14.820 --> 12:16.120
You said you'd run away

12:16.140 --> 12:18.250
in case of danger.

12:18.530 --> 12:21.130
Why did you break your words?

12:36.490 --> 12:38.370
He's not dead.

12:38.730 --> 12:40.010
Your Excellency.

12:41.490 --> 12:42.050
Your Excellency.

12:42.050 --> 12:42.800
Go away.

12:42.820 --> 12:43.370
Step aside!

12:43.370 --> 12:44.350
Your Excellency,

12:44.370 --> 12:45.350
we won't find the one behind all this

12:45.370 --> 12:46.850
and avenge Teng Zijing's death

12:46.850 --> 12:49.210
if he dies.

12:55.020 --> 12:56.520
Who will interrogate him?

12:57.410 --> 12:58.770
The Investigator's Office.

13:06.900 --> 13:10.840
Take Teng Zijing to the Fan mansion.

13:11.020 --> 13:12.370
Yes, Your Excellency.

13:12.580 --> 13:13.960
I will

13:14.170 --> 13:16.520
go to the Investigator's Office for the result tomorrow.

13:19.460 --> 13:21.320
Your Excellency, let me go back with you.

13:21.340 --> 13:22.720
No.

13:24.050 --> 13:26.480
No matter who it is,

13:26.780 --> 13:29.840
I'll give them one more chance to kill me.

13:46.410 --> 13:47.580
Why is he so seriously injured?

13:47.580 --> 13:49.400
Yeah. Where is he going?

13:55.220 --> 13:57.160
Brother, how are you feeling?

13:58.140 --> 13:59.400
I'm good.

13:59.850 --> 14:00.830
I've heard of it.

14:00.850 --> 14:02.210
It's all in the past.

14:03.850 --> 14:06.450
Send someone to tell Li Chengze

14:06.850 --> 14:08.390
an accident has happened to me

14:08.410 --> 14:10.770
and I can't make it today.

14:12.410 --> 14:13.720
Ruoruo,

14:15.050 --> 14:16.840
we're not going back to Danzhou.

14:33.970 --> 14:36.080
I'm afraid it's bad news.

14:39.490 --> 14:40.900
Cheng Jushu tried to assassinate Fan Xian

14:40.900 --> 14:42.280
on Niulan Street.

14:42.700 --> 14:43.710
What's the result?

14:43.730 --> 14:45.080
Two female assassinators

14:45.100 --> 14:46.960
and Fan Xian's guard were killed.

14:47.050 --> 14:48.570
Is Cheng Jushu still alive?

14:48.930 --> 14:50.510
He's taken away by the Investigator's Office.

14:50.530 --> 14:52.770
They must want to find the one behind this.

14:53.020 --> 14:54.950
Here is the capital city.

14:54.970 --> 14:56.720
Who dared to do that here?

14:56.930 --> 14:59.480
I'll be considered the most likely suspect.

14:59.610 --> 15:00.890
Your Highness.

15:01.220 --> 15:03.210
It's me that asked Fan Xian to be here

15:03.260 --> 15:05.000
and he was attacked on his way.

15:05.020 --> 15:06.840
Your Highness, let's go back.

15:25.340 --> 15:26.810
This matter

15:28.900 --> 15:31.690
may shock the whole city.

15:35.780 --> 15:38.040
Luckily, Fan Xian is all right.

15:43.260 --> 15:48.600
But, you're not shocked at all.

15:58.100 --> 16:00.130
Your Highness, what do you mean?

16:01.140 --> 16:02.690
I don't understand.

16:13.460 --> 16:15.440
You're not surprised

16:15.460 --> 16:17.450
when hearing about the assassination attempt.

16:18.610 --> 16:20.290
Did you expect

16:20.290 --> 16:22.280
it would happen?

16:26.930 --> 16:28.690
What are you going to do?

16:30.850 --> 16:34.080
I didn't mean it. Don't take it seriously.

17:37.530 --> 17:38.890
How is it going?

17:39.580 --> 17:40.800
Fan Xian

17:40.820 --> 17:42.010
reset the broken bone in his arm

17:42.010 --> 17:43.320
himself.

17:43.340 --> 17:44.890
He didn't send for a doctor.

17:45.860 --> 17:47.320
He's a real man.

17:47.340 --> 17:48.560
Like this.

17:48.980 --> 17:50.290
It's done.

17:51.380 --> 17:53.750
He looks quite calm.

17:53.770 --> 17:55.110
He doesn't cry or lose his temper.

17:55.130 --> 17:56.800
I think he's okay.

17:57.890 --> 17:59.290
He's holding back.

18:00.620 --> 18:02.150
No. It has been put back into place.

18:02.170 --> 18:03.200
Look.

18:03.220 --> 18:05.050
He did it himself. It's done.

18:14.130 --> 18:15.410
It's time for dinner.

18:24.410 --> 18:25.770
Where is Ruoruo?

18:26.820 --> 18:28.170
No idea.

18:28.770 --> 18:30.370
He came back alone.

18:30.580 --> 18:31.340
I don't know

18:31.340 --> 18:32.720
where she has gone.

18:33.500 --> 18:35.010
Ask your dad to come for dinner.

19:04.650 --> 19:07.890
Cheng Jushu is in custody at the Investigator's Office.

19:13.250 --> 19:14.010
Ruoruo

19:14.010 --> 19:16.200
has been waiting at the gate

19:16.220 --> 19:18.530
for the result.

19:21.620 --> 19:24.250
Who do you think it might be?

19:33.620 --> 19:36.600
Li Chengze is the most likely suspect.

19:36.620 --> 19:38.080
It's he that

19:38.380 --> 19:40.320
asked you to go to Joy Tsin House

19:40.410 --> 19:44.010
and you have to pass through Niulan Street to get there.

19:46.770 --> 19:48.410
If I were dead,

19:48.980 --> 19:50.680
everyone would suspect him.

19:50.740 --> 19:54.200
So, it's someone else.

19:59.700 --> 20:01.560
I want to know

20:03.500 --> 20:04.800
where the Crown Prince went

20:04.820 --> 20:05.910
and what he did today.

20:05.930 --> 20:07.680
You don't have the right

20:07.700 --> 20:09.560
to ask about his whereabouts.

20:11.250 --> 20:15.030
The one behind the scenes is still a mystery.

20:15.050 --> 20:18.560
Don't act rashly.

20:25.860 --> 20:27.170
I'm done.

21:26.010 --> 21:27.650
I've heard of it.

21:30.100 --> 21:32.010
I've heard it's a fierce battle.

21:33.340 --> 21:35.080
I've been worried about you.

21:35.620 --> 21:36.960
Teng Zijing

21:39.130 --> 21:40.480
is dead.

21:44.980 --> 21:46.680
He was your guard.

21:49.580 --> 21:51.010
No, he wasn't.

21:55.050 --> 21:56.680
He was an idiot.

22:10.410 --> 22:12.440
Tell me his story.

22:13.130 --> 22:14.410
Okay?

22:16.740 --> 22:18.290
I received a secret order

22:18.410 --> 22:20.050
from the Investigator's Office to kill the traitor.

22:20.220 --> 22:21.930
You're from the Investigator's Office.

22:22.250 --> 22:23.270
Fan Xian,

22:23.290 --> 22:24.960
I need a favor from you.

22:25.340 --> 22:26.800
Please kill me.

22:26.860 --> 22:28.130
The Investigator's Office has special file record

22:28.130 --> 22:29.230
of all cases.

22:29.250 --> 22:30.200
If you can bring me

22:30.220 --> 22:32.110
my file which doesn't have much importance,

22:32.130 --> 22:33.410
I'd give my life

22:33.410 --> 22:34.170
to you.

22:34.170 --> 22:35.960
I can give you a hand

22:36.290 --> 22:37.340
no matter what you want to do.

22:37.340 --> 22:38.600
Don't bother!

22:38.620 --> 22:39.290
We're bound to each other by no ties.

22:39.290 --> 22:40.960
You don't have to do anything for me!

22:41.340 --> 22:42.930
Why did you help me?

22:43.820 --> 22:45.200
I want to help my friend.

22:45.460 --> 22:46.560
The capital city is not a safe place.

22:46.580 --> 22:48.360
It's good for you to leave here earlier.

22:48.380 --> 22:49.100
Or your families

22:49.100 --> 22:50.840
will always worry about you.

22:52.130 --> 22:53.440
You won't leave the capital city?

22:53.460 --> 22:55.080
You are so stupid. If I leave here,

22:55.100 --> 22:55.980
I'm afraid you can't survive

22:55.980 --> 22:57.200
by yourself.

22:57.220 --> 22:59.510
Then you'd better do a good job!

22:59.530 --> 23:00.840
I'm afraid I can't.

23:00.860 --> 23:01.530
I owe this life

23:01.530 --> 23:02.960
to my family.

23:02.980 --> 23:04.200
As to you,

23:04.250 --> 23:05.250
when there's danger,

23:05.250 --> 23:06.440
you should face it yourself.

23:06.460 --> 23:08.560
I'll run away immediately.

23:09.820 --> 23:11.130
You leave now.

23:12.050 --> 23:13.370
Let's go together.

23:14.130 --> 23:15.650
Go!

23:18.620 --> 23:20.480
He told me

23:20.650 --> 23:21.820
he'd run away

23:21.820 --> 23:23.250
in case of danger.

23:24.980 --> 23:26.480
Why did he lie to me?

23:27.700 --> 23:31.480
He told you the answer.

23:36.380 --> 23:38.290
You mentioned it just now.

23:40.340 --> 23:42.170
He said it today.

23:42.650 --> 23:44.170
If there is nobody

23:44.170 --> 23:45.650
you would die for,

23:45.700 --> 23:47.410
you'll be bored with life.

23:50.620 --> 23:51.960
If there is nobody

23:52.290 --> 23:54.770
you would die for,

23:57.380 --> 23:59.480
you'll be bored with life.

24:04.050 --> 24:07.250
He meant his family.

24:08.250 --> 24:09.960
For him,

24:11.010 --> 24:12.680
you're also family.

24:16.340 --> 24:17.600
Yes.

25:04.100 --> 25:06.370
Who tried to assassinate Fan Xian?

25:07.580 --> 25:08.960
I'm ignorant sometimes,

25:08.980 --> 25:10.750
but I'd never dare to do that.

25:10.770 --> 25:12.800
I've been getting well along with Fan Xian.

25:12.820 --> 25:14.990
I really have no reason to kill him.

25:15.010 --> 25:16.930
Then who do you think it is?

25:17.380 --> 25:19.200
The assassinators are warriors from Beiqi.

25:19.220 --> 25:21.560
It may be their plot.

25:21.980 --> 25:23.220
It makes sense.

25:23.220 --> 25:25.580
But I don't understand

25:25.580 --> 25:28.050
why they want to do that.

25:28.050 --> 25:29.390
Are they also angry with Fan Xian

25:29.410 --> 25:31.960
and anxious to avenge Guo Baokun's injuries?

25:32.980 --> 25:34.290
I'd never do such a thing

25:34.290 --> 25:35.440
for Guo Baokun.

25:35.460 --> 25:36.960
I believe what you said,

25:36.980 --> 25:41.010
but I really can't think of anyone else

25:41.220 --> 25:43.080
who has a grudge against Fan Xian

25:43.170 --> 25:45.200
in the capital city.

25:45.220 --> 25:48.530
Chengze, do you know gossip is a fearful thing?

25:48.980 --> 25:50.390
Do you think

25:50.410 --> 25:52.390
murder is a solution to problems?

25:52.410 --> 25:53.510
Of course not.

25:53.530 --> 25:55.150
There are so many complicated things in the world.

25:55.170 --> 25:57.170
How could they be solved by murder?

25:57.410 --> 25:59.170
I agree.

26:00.010 --> 26:01.840
I think murder is a solution to problems.

26:02.340 --> 26:04.100
You can kill Fan Xian if he's in the way.

26:04.100 --> 26:06.870
You can kill officials if they suspect you.

26:06.890 --> 26:09.150
You can kill the whole staff of the Investigator's Office

26:09.170 --> 26:11.720
if they make detailed inquires.

26:11.740 --> 26:13.680
You can also kill me

26:13.700 --> 26:15.650
if I'm suspicious.

26:15.980 --> 26:18.630
Murder seems like a solution to problems,

26:18.650 --> 26:22.480
but only the unpardonably wicked would turn to that.

26:22.500 --> 26:24.200
I'd be destroyed by heaven and earth

26:24.220 --> 26:25.720
if I meant to do that.

26:25.740 --> 26:27.080
So would I.

26:27.100 --> 26:29.050
Then stop sounding each other out.

26:29.050 --> 26:30.700
How can you rule the world

26:30.700 --> 26:33.770
if you aren't large-hearted enough?

26:35.980 --> 26:38.220
You despised the national law

26:38.220 --> 26:41.440
by acting in such a foolhardy manner.

26:41.890 --> 26:43.150
You can leave.

26:43.170 --> 26:44.480
Your Majesty,

26:45.650 --> 26:47.560
here is a secret report from the Investigator's Office.

26:51.010 --> 26:53.840
They want to set Cheng Jushu free?

26:53.860 --> 26:54.600
Yes.

26:54.620 --> 26:55.600
Did Fan Xian know that?

26:55.620 --> 26:57.410
Not yet.

26:57.620 --> 26:59.080
Then tell him.

26:59.100 --> 27:00.530
Yes, Your Majesty.

27:27.170 --> 27:28.410
Thank you.

27:32.220 --> 27:33.680
I must leave.

27:33.700 --> 27:35.170
Where are you going?

27:35.890 --> 27:37.800
Teng Zijing died because of me.

27:38.100 --> 27:39.680
His wife and son

27:41.650 --> 27:43.320
still don't know about that.

27:45.860 --> 27:47.250
I have to tell them.

27:50.290 --> 27:51.560
My Lady.

27:53.530 --> 27:55.930
Lady Fan Ruoruo is here.

27:57.500 --> 27:58.910
Let her in.

27:58.930 --> 28:00.250
Got it.

28:05.650 --> 28:08.960
Brother, Cheng Jushu will be set free.

28:19.890 --> 28:20.750
Your Excellency.

28:20.770 --> 28:21.840
Where is Cheng Jushu?

28:21.860 --> 28:23.380
In the dungeon.

28:23.380 --> 28:25.050
Have you found out the one behind this?

28:25.250 --> 28:26.110
He said nothing.

28:26.130 --> 28:27.530
What will you do with him?

28:27.770 --> 28:28.440
Your Excellency.

28:28.460 --> 28:29.680
Answer me!

28:30.250 --> 28:31.360
He'll be sent out of town.

28:31.380 --> 28:32.560
And then?

28:33.010 --> 28:34.530
He'll be set free.

28:35.820 --> 28:36.910
Who made the decision?

28:36.930 --> 28:38.510
Generally, when the Head is not in the capital city,

28:38.530 --> 28:39.600
Mr. Zhu Ge,

28:39.620 --> 28:40.530
director of the First Division,

28:40.530 --> 28:41.720
will take care of all matters related.

28:41.740 --> 28:42.440
Take me to him.

28:42.460 --> 28:43.050
Your Excellency.

28:43.050 --> 28:44.800
Take me to him!

28:45.340 --> 28:46.680
Please follow me.

28:47.820 --> 28:49.910
The Investigator's Office is divided into eight divisions,

28:49.930 --> 28:50.990
each of which performs its own functions.

28:51.010 --> 28:52.980
The First Division is responsible for

28:52.980 --> 28:54.170
supervising officials in the capital city.

28:54.170 --> 28:56.080
This is the most important unit.

28:57.500 --> 28:59.960
Zhu Ge has followed the Head for years.

28:59.980 --> 29:02.680
He's powerful and influential.

29:03.580 --> 29:05.150
And he's particularly severe.

29:05.170 --> 29:05.910
Right here.

29:05.930 --> 29:07.080
Your Excellency,

29:07.100 --> 29:08.150
please be cautious with your words and actions

29:08.170 --> 29:10.600
when you see him.

29:16.530 --> 29:17.800
Your Excellency,

29:19.050 --> 29:21.200
Mr. Fan Xian, a disciple of Master Fei

29:21.220 --> 29:22.620
and Director-General of the Investigator's Office,

29:22.620 --> 29:24.770
wants to see you.

29:24.860 --> 29:26.170
I'm not available.

29:27.820 --> 29:29.930
Be cautious with your words and actions.

29:31.500 --> 29:32.680
Your Excellency.

29:34.740 --> 29:36.130
Your Excellency.

29:37.930 --> 29:39.530
You want to set Cheng Jushu free?

29:41.340 --> 29:43.600
Among the eight directors of the Investigator's Office,

29:43.620 --> 29:44.680
Fei Jie ranks third

29:44.700 --> 29:45.560
as for his capabilities,

29:45.560 --> 29:46.770
as for his capabilities,
=Zhu Ge, Director of the First Division=

29:46.770 --> 29:48.080
=Zhu Ge, director of the First Division
of the Investigator's Office=

29:48.100 --> 29:49.720
but I look down upon him most

29:49.980 --> 29:52.680
as for the way he behaves.

29:52.890 --> 29:55.700
He can't make a clear distinction
between public and private interests

29:55.700 --> 29:58.650
or between the important and the less important.

29:58.700 --> 30:00.680
As his disciple,

30:00.700 --> 30:03.130
you'd better not follow him in this respect.

30:03.130 --> 30:04.720
Why do you want to set Cheng Jushu free?

30:04.740 --> 30:06.500
You just need to obey orders.

30:06.500 --> 30:07.960
Don't ask unnecessary questions.

30:10.650 --> 30:12.770
As Direction-General of the Investigator's Office,

30:12.930 --> 30:14.130
I don't need to follow any of the eight directors.

30:14.130 --> 30:15.860
I have the same seniority as you.

30:15.860 --> 30:17.840
The token is not false, right?

30:19.410 --> 30:20.600
Right.

30:20.740 --> 30:23.130
Okay. Let me repeat it.

30:23.890 --> 30:26.080
Why do you want to set Cheng Jushu free?

30:31.170 --> 30:33.050
According to an urgent report from the Ministry of War,

30:34.380 --> 30:37.630
there is an emergency deployment
of armies at the northern border.

30:37.650 --> 30:39.720
A war may break out at any moment.

30:39.740 --> 30:41.630
Nanqing has planning a war against Beiqi

30:41.650 --> 30:42.960
for a long time,

30:42.980 --> 30:44.960
but the timing of making war

30:44.980 --> 30:47.510
has to be decided by us.

30:47.530 --> 30:50.110
How is it related to Cheng Jushu?

30:50.130 --> 30:53.270
Cheng Jushu is a martial arts master of Beiqi.

30:53.290 --> 30:55.110
If he dies in the capital city,

30:55.130 --> 30:57.080
it may give Beiqi an excuse.

30:57.100 --> 30:59.680
The national plans will be destroyed

30:59.700 --> 31:01.860
in case they attack us at this time.

31:01.860 --> 31:03.370
In case?

31:05.170 --> 31:06.600
That's why you made that decision?

31:06.620 --> 31:09.600
One of Cheng Jushu's friends

31:09.620 --> 31:11.770
is a general of Beiqi.

31:12.010 --> 31:13.230
He promised

31:13.250 --> 31:15.440
he'd provide us

31:15.460 --> 31:17.560
with details about the deployment

31:17.580 --> 31:19.290
of forces at the border

31:19.290 --> 31:21.110
if we keep Cheng Jushu safe.

31:21.130 --> 31:22.980
So, you did business with him.

31:22.980 --> 31:24.460
No matter what we do,

31:24.460 --> 31:26.720
we have to put the country's interests first.

31:26.740 --> 31:28.530
But if we can only win at the
sacrifice of the innocent people,

31:28.530 --> 31:30.270
then what's the meaning of it!

31:30.290 --> 31:31.380
It's a matter concerning national safety.

31:31.380 --> 31:33.130
It's not up to you.

31:33.130 --> 31:34.250
A life for a life.

31:34.250 --> 31:35.740
This is the law.

31:35.740 --> 31:36.580
It's just a guard

31:36.580 --> 31:38.530
that was killed.

31:40.620 --> 31:43.840
Just a guard?

31:49.410 --> 31:50.680
Your Excellency,

31:52.050 --> 31:54.720
the stone tablet at the gate says

31:54.740 --> 31:56.720
men are created equal

31:56.740 --> 31:58.800
and there is neither lowliness nor nobleness,

31:58.820 --> 32:01.960
on which the Investigator's Office is based.

32:02.740 --> 32:04.480
A guard is also a man.

32:04.930 --> 32:07.530
He's a father.

32:09.050 --> 32:11.890
He's a husband.

32:13.010 --> 32:15.960
He's the only one his family can depend on.

32:17.170 --> 32:19.530
The victim is dead,

32:19.530 --> 32:21.930
but the murderer will be set free.

32:23.050 --> 32:24.650
Where is the national law?

32:27.010 --> 32:29.250
Where is the justice?

32:33.820 --> 32:36.720
It's already been decided.

32:36.980 --> 32:39.560
There is no room for negotiation.

32:41.050 --> 32:42.320
Guards!

32:45.050 --> 32:46.080
Here.

32:46.100 --> 32:47.960
Tell everyone

32:47.980 --> 32:49.480
the First Division

32:49.500 --> 32:51.270
is responsible for Cheng Jushu's case.

32:51.290 --> 32:53.820
Nobody should hand him over to anyone else

32:53.820 --> 32:55.630
even if he has the token for Director-General.

32:55.650 --> 32:56.960
Yes.

33:00.100 --> 33:02.480
You'd better give up that idea.

33:05.860 --> 33:07.650
Go home and have a good rest.

33:11.290 --> 33:12.680
Your Excellency,

33:15.050 --> 33:16.680
don't you feel ashamed?

33:23.930 --> 33:25.560
I'm leaving.

33:59.650 --> 34:01.320
Does anyone believe

34:02.380 --> 34:03.840
what it says?

34:06.380 --> 34:08.080
Wang Qinian, answer me!

34:08.100 --> 34:10.470
Does anyone believe what it says?

34:10.490 --> 34:11.690
Your Excellency,

34:11.940 --> 34:13.600
such being the case,

34:13.820 --> 34:15.370
you've tried your best.

34:16.420 --> 34:17.690
Fan!

34:18.940 --> 34:22.080
His Highness and I want to say sorry.

34:22.820 --> 34:23.820
If His Highness hadn't invited you

34:23.820 --> 34:25.270
to go to Joy Tsin House,

34:25.290 --> 34:27.320
such an accident couldn't have happened to you.

34:28.730 --> 34:30.360
But Fan, please believe us.

34:30.380 --> 34:31.080
His Highness

34:31.100 --> 34:32.600
couldn't have tried to assassinate you.

34:32.620 --> 34:33.840
Can you do me a favor?

34:33.860 --> 34:35.040
Go ahead.

34:35.180 --> 34:36.050
Get Cheng Jushu

34:36.050 --> 34:37.290
out of the Investigator's Office

34:37.290 --> 34:39.170
and kill him!

34:41.180 --> 34:42.370
Fan,

34:42.580 --> 34:44.750
His Highness could do that

34:44.770 --> 34:47.160
if Cheng Jushu is locked in the Ministry of Penalty,

34:47.180 --> 34:49.130
the Capital Garrison or the Prefecture of Capital City.

34:50.100 --> 34:51.120
But he's in the Investigator's Office.

34:51.140 --> 34:52.880
His Majesty has given orders

34:52.900 --> 34:54.510
nobody is allowed to step in.

34:54.530 --> 34:56.800
Even the Crown Prince doesn't have the right to meddle.

34:59.620 --> 35:01.580
How about

35:01.580 --> 35:02.800
compensating that guard's family

35:02.820 --> 35:04.950
with a large amount of money?

35:04.970 --> 35:06.490
If it were you,

35:06.860 --> 35:08.050
how much can compensate

35:08.050 --> 35:09.730
for the loss of your family?

35:16.770 --> 35:18.470
I won't make things difficult for you.

35:18.490 --> 35:19.930
So much for this.

35:33.660 --> 35:34.930
Why are you following me?

35:35.690 --> 35:37.520
Let me walk you home.

35:39.100 --> 35:40.100
Is there anyone in the capital city

35:40.100 --> 35:40.900
who's not afraid of

35:40.900 --> 35:42.410
the Investigator's Office?

35:43.380 --> 35:44.470
None.

35:44.490 --> 35:45.600
The Imperial Guards and the Capital Garrison

35:45.620 --> 35:48.080
are in the control of the Investigation's Office.

35:48.290 --> 35:50.800
The Prefecture of Capital City is afraid of them.

35:50.820 --> 35:52.560
Members of the royal family
are not allowed to get involved.

35:52.580 --> 35:55.800
All officers at court are worldly-wise and play safe.

35:56.100 --> 35:58.800
Your token won't work

35:58.970 --> 36:00.420
and your father is just

36:00.420 --> 36:01.840
Assistant Minister of Revenue.

36:02.180 --> 36:03.900
I've thought about

36:03.900 --> 36:05.360
every possible way.

36:05.380 --> 36:07.320
I'm afraid we can do nothing about it.

36:10.820 --> 36:11.490
When will Cheng Jushu

36:11.490 --> 36:12.510
be taken out of the Investigator's Office?

36:12.530 --> 36:14.030
I think it's this afternoon.

36:14.050 --> 36:15.930
Find out the exact time.

36:20.970 --> 36:22.270
This is all I have with me right now.

36:22.290 --> 36:23.930
I'll get more later.

36:30.970 --> 36:33.690
Please go back and wait at home.

36:35.900 --> 36:37.080
Thank you.

36:37.100 --> 36:38.190
Your Excellency,

36:38.210 --> 36:41.030
I'll get it done because you paid for it.

36:41.050 --> 36:43.370
Don't thank me.

37:01.050 --> 37:01.750
Mom.

37:01.770 --> 37:03.530
Why did you stay up last night?

37:03.530 --> 37:05.800
Why didn't you blow out the lamp?

37:09.580 --> 37:11.450
Why hasn't my dad been back?

37:15.820 --> 37:17.900
I think he's nice to me.

37:17.900 --> 37:19.690
I'll call him dad more often.

37:19.690 --> 37:21.210
He likes to hear that.

37:22.770 --> 37:24.000
Okay.

37:24.530 --> 37:25.420
I want to buy

37:25.420 --> 37:27.470
candied haws

37:27.490 --> 37:29.560
for my friend who lives in the box.

37:30.450 --> 37:32.080
Ask your dad to come back early

37:32.620 --> 37:34.370
if you see him.

37:35.530 --> 37:37.420
I'll get candied haws

37:37.420 --> 37:39.730
for my friend who lives in the box.

38:02.450 --> 38:03.690
Um.

38:04.290 --> 38:05.190
Fan Xian,

38:05.210 --> 38:07.670
is it really okay to put the coffin

38:07.690 --> 38:09.560
in the yard?

38:09.580 --> 38:11.280
I'll send him back

38:11.580 --> 38:13.040
when I get things done.

38:14.420 --> 38:15.650
Get things done?

38:16.340 --> 38:17.730
What things?

38:18.140 --> 38:21.560
Why do you keep sharpening the dagger?

38:21.580 --> 38:23.990
Brother, what can I do for you?

38:24.010 --> 38:25.760
Just stay at home.

38:37.140 --> 38:38.410
How is it going?

38:39.210 --> 38:40.320
I've checked it out.

38:40.340 --> 38:41.640
He'll be taken away

38:41.660 --> 38:43.360
from the Investigator's Office in an hour.

38:43.380 --> 38:45.800
He'll get out of town from the
North Gate and leaves by water.

38:47.940 --> 38:49.210
Wait for me at home.

38:50.970 --> 38:52.080
Brother.

38:55.940 --> 38:57.320
I don't like it.

38:57.340 --> 38:59.000
I wish I could do something to help.

39:00.180 --> 39:01.520
Go along this street

39:01.730 --> 39:02.920
to be out of town from the North Gate.

39:02.940 --> 39:05.240
There is a small forest before you arrive at the wharf.

39:05.490 --> 39:06.640
It's the most suitable place

39:06.660 --> 39:08.040
for you to kill Cheng Jushu.

39:08.180 --> 39:09.640
A forest out of town?

39:09.660 --> 39:12.040
Right. This is the only choice.

39:12.180 --> 39:14.250
Find a way to distract the escorts.

39:14.250 --> 39:16.520
Then kill Cheng Jushu while nobody else is around.

39:16.580 --> 39:18.120
In this case, even if His Excellency knows

39:18.140 --> 39:19.640
it's you that have done it,

39:19.660 --> 39:20.820
he can do nothing

39:20.820 --> 39:22.800
without strong evidence.

39:23.050 --> 39:24.400
However, Cheng Jushu

39:24.420 --> 39:25.470
is seriously injured,

39:25.490 --> 39:27.160
but he's an Eighth Dan Martial Arts Master, anyway,

39:27.180 --> 39:28.990
and you haven't made a recovery,

39:29.010 --> 39:30.690
so, it's a little risky.

39:33.050 --> 39:34.160
Your Excellency,

39:34.180 --> 39:36.030
you have to go this way to be out of town.

39:36.050 --> 39:37.930
Who said I'd do that?

39:38.210 --> 39:39.770
The forest is the only place

39:39.770 --> 39:40.990
where there won't be pedestrians.

39:41.010 --> 39:42.450
Why do I have to avoid them?

39:43.250 --> 39:44.840
Thank you for providing information.

39:44.900 --> 39:46.080
From now on,

39:46.100 --> 39:48.370
stop following me to avoid getting involved.

39:48.660 --> 39:49.600
Your Excellency,

39:49.620 --> 39:51.410
where are you going to do that?

40:10.290 --> 40:11.250
As His Excellency said,

40:11.250 --> 40:12.880
we'll keep you safe in Nanqing.

40:12.900 --> 40:13.860
Don't forget to ask your friend

40:13.860 --> 40:15.180
to collect information on deployment of forces

40:15.180 --> 40:16.320
when you go back to Beiqi.

40:16.340 --> 40:18.360
And, keep silent when you go out.

40:18.380 --> 40:19.430
Follow us out of town.

40:19.450 --> 40:21.360
There is a boat at the wharf
and you'll go back to Beiqi by water.

40:21.380 --> 40:22.560
Remember.

40:22.580 --> 40:23.950
Never stop when you go out.

40:23.970 --> 40:26.080
We'll get into trouble if you're found.

40:26.100 --> 40:27.410
Got it?

40:27.730 --> 40:29.040
Let's go.

41:06.940 --> 41:08.240
It's weird.

41:14.250 --> 41:15.160
Go.

41:15.180 --> 41:16.670
-Go! -Go!

41:16.690 --> 41:17.840
Go!

41:18.180 --> 41:19.370
What are you looking at?

41:28.690 --> 41:29.800
His Excellency said

41:29.820 --> 41:31.530
you have no right

41:31.530 --> 41:33.210
to meddle in this matter.

41:42.210 --> 41:44.240
I'm not here to meddle.

41:49.900 --> 41:51.650
I'm here to kill him.

41:52.050 --> 41:53.320
Your Excellency.

41:54.490 --> 41:56.160
We work for the Investigator's Office.

41:56.180 --> 41:58.890
Someone asked me to kill you when nobody is around,

41:59.210 --> 42:00.760
but I don't like it.

42:01.210 --> 42:02.750
You're so cruel as to kill people in broad daylight.

42:02.770 --> 42:05.430
What you did is unforgivable.

42:05.450 --> 42:06.940
I'll kill you

42:06.940 --> 42:09.130
in public!

42:09.530 --> 42:11.970
Someone wants to do business with you,

42:12.380 --> 42:13.970
but I don't.

42:14.820 --> 42:17.080
They don't kill you for overall interests.

42:17.180 --> 42:18.690
Let me do it!

42:18.900 --> 42:20.190
Delay Fan Xian.

42:20.210 --> 42:21.800
Follow me! Go!

42:21.820 --> 42:22.970
Go!

42:25.970 --> 42:27.360
I've made much progress

42:27.380 --> 42:29.210
since my last battle with you.

42:29.690 --> 42:31.760
You'll die today!

42:57.680 --> 43:01.260
In the river of history,

43:01.280 --> 43:04.750
time goes round and round.

43:07.560 --> 43:10.900
Memories about the former and present lives

43:10.920 --> 43:14.990
join each other in an endless way.

43:16.880 --> 43:19.500
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:19.520 --> 43:21.760
one season follows another in a flash,

43:21.760 --> 43:24.260
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:24.280 --> 43:25.880
I just can't give up

43:25.880 --> 43:29.220
to be with you for my whole life.

43:29.240 --> 43:34.710
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:35.960 --> 43:38.510
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:38.800 --> 43:40.840
Year after year in the wandering,

43:40.840 --> 43:43.500
I count the remaining years.

43:43.520 --> 43:45.700
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:45.720 --> 43:47.710
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:48.000 --> 43:50.390
I never feel regretful.

43:50.440 --> 43:51.800
In such a chaotic world,

43:51.800 --> 43:54.780
I still miss you as ever.

43:54.800 --> 43:57.750
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

43:58.040 --> 44:00.100
With a gentle heart,

44:00.120 --> 44:02.780
I cherish our remaining years.

44:02.800 --> 44:04.320
Even though we have to go through

44:04.320 --> 44:06.830
all the hardships along the journey,

44:06.960 --> 44:14.150
you always stay by my side,

44:14.240 --> 44:16.910
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:17.200 --> 44:19.280
Year after year in the wandering,

44:19.280 --> 44:21.940
I count the remaining years.

44:21.960 --> 44:24.100
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:24.120 --> 44:26.350
even though we end up the destiny,

44:26.560 --> 44:28.740
I never feel regretful.

44:28.760 --> 44:30.160
In such a chaotic world,

44:30.160 --> 44:33.220
I still miss you as ever.

44:33.240 --> 44:36.350
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:36.440 --> 44:38.580
With a gentle heart,

44:38.600 --> 44:41.300
I cherish our remaining years.

44:41.320 --> 44:42.760
Even though we have to go through

44:42.760 --> 44:45.420
all the hardships along the journey,

44:45.440 --> 44:54.200
you always stay by my side...
